{
  "_comment": "Declarative UI layout for the hex-world view/sim controls. The host parses this and exposes it to Lua as the `UI` global (flicker-script set_global_json); scripts/hex_ui.lua reads named elements and emits draw commands. Colors are RGBA 0..1; positions/sizes are HUD pixels (origin top-left). Edit and relaunch to restyle. Checkbox keys + the slider/dropdown/button values flow back through the engine Model.",

